  "description": "Originally, Aichi Coexistence Private Academy was an all-girls school for privileged young ladies until it was decided that it would become co-ed. The fearful girls were permitted to bring weapons to protect themselves, and then a vigilante group was established called the “Supreme Five Swords.\" When rebellious Nomura Fudou is sent to the academy, he is given two options: act and dress like a girl or be expelled!<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)",
  "siteUrl": "https://anilist.co/anime/21851",
  "characters": [
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 121446,
        "name": {
          "full": "Fudou Nomura",
          "native": "納村不道",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121446-TrmaeTxiMN95.png"
        },
        "description": "Nomura is a pacifist by nature, but his freedom-loving ideals as well as his cheeky attitude often finds himself rebelling against figures of power and authority. Ultimately, though, he’s a relatively laid-back guy with a cheerful demeanor.\n\nNomura was originally a talented user of the Jigen-ryū school of Japanese swordsmanship; however, due to extremely harsh and rushed training enforced by his former master, his body was broken beyond repair, which made him incapable of picking up a sword ever again. Instead, he developed his capabilities in hand-to-hand combat, and eventually crafted a powerful technique known as “Madan” (Magic Bullet). This technique utilizes muscle control to focus his strength into the palm of his hand, allowing for a devastating palm strike akin to a shock-wave from any position he so chooses.\n",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 107018,
          "name": {
            "full": "Tasuku Hatanaka",
            "native": "畠中祐"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n107018-UwRPnTdllbPT.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 121447,
        "name": {
          "full": "Rin Onigawara",
          "native": "鬼瓦輪",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121447-du1eMv8Jtz0V.png"
        },
        "description": "Leader of the Tenka Goken. Onigawara is known for being merciless and a prominent hater of men, causing many to quit the academy. However, she softens significantly after meeting Nomura, showing many signs of affection.\n\nWhen her father abandoned their family after having an affair, Onigawara had to deal with the mental backlash of her distraught mother. Because she resembled her father, her mother would call her “ugly” or “ the child of a demon” and would demand her to wear a demon’s mask whenever she was around. This would cement the thought that Onigawara was hiding her “shameful self” by wearing the mask and continued to do so even after she left home.\n\nOnigawara is a skilled practitioner of the Kashima Shinden Jikishinkage-ryū school of Japanese swordsmanship. This style places an emphasis on proper breath control, allowing for improved strength and speed.\n",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 119154,
          "name": {
            "full": "Yuuki Takada",
            "native": "高田憂希"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n119154-sWANDEExAuVD.jpg"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 121449,
        "name": {
          "full": "Kirukiru Amou",
          "native": "天羽斬々",
          "alternative": [
            "Empress"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121449-zePNc0SySKvR.png"
        },
        "description": "A deranged psychopath carrying an unhealthy obsession with [Fudou Nomura](https://anilist.co/character/121446/Nomura-Fudou), seemingly stemming from a twisted sense of love where she demands his total submission before her and is willing to kill him otherwise. She earns the title of “Empress” after defeating two members of the Tenka Goken simultaneously.\n\nAmou specializes in Uechi-ryuu, a traditional style of Okinawan Karate that emphasizes toughness of the body by being attacked and pained while practicing nukite based counter-attacks to a point of being able to respond reflexively. This is the basis for her technique “Auto-counter”.\n",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 115835,
          "name": {
            "full": "Eriko Matsui",
            "native": "松井恵理子"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n115835-3uhE3pEKEsEN.png"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 121453,
        "name": {
          "full": "Tsukuyo Inaba",
          "native": "因幡月夜",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121453-5LfXUahqrTZx.png"
        },
        "description": "Tsukuyo is a child prodigy that skipped several grades, making her the youngest member of the Tenka Goken. Despite being so young, however, she is unquestionably the strongest member. \n\nWhile blind, she has excellent hearing, to the point that she is capable of hearing most things going on in the academy. Even though she carries a calm and collected demeanor, she can still act childishly, much like the many instances where she likes to show off her knowledge resulting in long rambles.\n\nTsukuyo is a skilled user of the Yakumaru Jigen-ryū, the descendant style of the Jigen-ryū that Nomura practiced.\n",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 112777,
          "name": {
            "full": "Natsumi Hioka",
            "native": "日岡なつみ"
          },
          "image": {
            "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n112777-ZK3Jxr4CpZiC.png"
